metadata/design_notes = "A queue: six posts in a line across the middle of the room, the one Help Desk room with nothing in the corners. Enemies start above and below the line and the player picks a gap to fight through, or runs the length of it to the other side. Difficulty 2, because the line hides nothing; it only decides where the shots can cross."
